msgctxt "appimage-on-the-fly"
msgid ""
"Here are listed $COUNT AppImages (including $ITEM_COUNT metapackage items) "
"built on the fly from the official portable builds, showing how easily "
"portable apps can be converted to AppImages to gain isolated dotfiles, "
